  "answer_text": "Here are the login options for **PreLicenseTraining.com**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd10 PreLicenseTraining.com Login\n\n**PreLicenseTraining.com** offers insurance pre-license training and continuing education courses online for insurance professionals.\n\nYou can access the login pages through the following links:\n\n| Portal | Login URL |\n|---|---|\n| \ud83d\udc64 **Student Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/login](https://prelicensetraining.com/login) |\n| \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfeb **Mentor / Recruiter Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register) |\n| \ud83d\udcdd **New Student Registration** | [prelicensetraining.com/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/register) |\n\n---\n\n### Tips:\n- If you **already have an account**, go directly to the **Student Login** page.\n- If you are a **Mentor or Recruiter**, use the Mentor Portal link.\n- If you're **new**, click the Registration link to create an account.\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f If you're having trouble logging in (forgotten password, account issues, etc.), look for a **\"Forgot Password\"** option on the login page, or contact their support team directly through the website.",
